# L §5.14.3 (round 12): "a place of unit any ... is refused (LOAD-UNIT where load sees it ...)": f's place is a key
# of the prelude kind outside, whose unit is any (L §5.10); load sees it: LOAD-UNIT.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int

move wage[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN
  dom = 10
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

def f[p in outside]: money PLN = flows(p, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-03-31) at reader
ask q: f[world]
=== expect
refused: LOAD-UNIT ...
